Package: numbers
Type: Package
Title: Numbers Algorithms in Three Approaches
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yorche", email = "hyaoki123@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Specification 04_Numbers: the five numeric algorithms (sum of the
    first n numbers, factorial, fibonacci, greatest common divisor and least
    common multiple) in three approaches each: direct recursion, accumulator
    recursion and iteration.
